Z||000012||pontiacs4me||09-06-2001||02:04 AM||||Im selling my last pair of paragon hood vents for $40 shipped, check them out!<BR> <A HREF="http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/paragonvents1.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/paragonvents1.jpg</A> <P><BR>Oh btw, I always thought Phils hood vents came off an camaro hood.  ?????<BR> <A HREF="http://www.3gc.net/camaro.shtml" TARGET=_blank>http://www.3gc.net/camaro.shtml</A>   check out the top pic of the blue convertible.<p>[This message has been edited by pontiacs4me (edited 09-06-2001).]||||reg||1
